{% set heroes = [] %}{% set bios = [] %}{% set courses = [] %}
{% for s in home.sections %}{% if s.id == 'top' %}{% set _ = heroes.push(s) %}{% endif %}{% if s.id == 'about' %}{% set _ = bios.push(s) %}{% endif %}{% if s.id == 'for-whom' %}{% set _ = courses.push(s) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% set tools = home.tools %}{% set studio = home.studio %}{% set hero = heroes[0] %}{% set about = bios[0] %}{% set learning = courses[0] %}
{% if motion_demo %}<aside class="motion-toolbar" aria-label="모션 데모 설정"><span>처치AI랩 · 디자인 데모</span><div><button type="button" data-motion-toggle aria-pressed="true">모션 켜짐</button><button type="button" data-motion-replay>처음부터 보기</button><a href="/">현재 홈페이지</a></div></aside>{% endif %}
<section class="studio-intro has-hero-video" id="intro">
  <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/media/hero-poster.webp"><img class="hero-bg-poster" src="/media/hero-poster.jpg" alt="" width="1280" height="720" decoding="async"></picture><video class="hero-bg-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/hero-poster.jpg" src="/media/hero-bg.mp4" width="1280" height="720"></video><div class="hero-shade"></div></div>
  <div class="studio-wrap">
  <div class="intro-top"><p>목회자를 위한 AI 활용 교육</p><span>Church AI Lab</span></div>
  <h1><span class="title-line"><span>{{ studio.hero_line1 | br | safe }}</span></span><span class="title-line"><span>{{ studio.hero_line2 | br | safe }}</span></span></h1>
  <div class="intro-bottom"><span class="scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><p>설교준비, 목회행정, 교회교육, 나만의 AI 도구.<br>지금 필요한 사역부터 함께 연습합니다.</p><a class="studio-link" href="#lab">어떻게 활용하나요? <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="lab-section" id="lab" aria-labelledby="lab-heading">
  <div class="studio-wrap lab-head"><h2 id="lab-heading">{{ studio.lab_heading | br | safe }}</h2><p>네 가지 활용 장면을 눌러 보세요.</p></div>
  <div class="studio-wrap lab-console" data-lab data-showcase>
    <div class="lab-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="활용 장면">
      {% for example in hero.showcase %}<button type="button" role="tab" id="lab-tab-{{ loop.index0 }}" aria-controls="lab-panel-{{ loop.index0 }}" aria-selected="{% if loop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" {% if not loop.first %}tabindex="-1"{% endif %}>{{ example.label }}</button>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% set requests = studio.requests %}
    {% set outputs = studio.outputs %}
    {% for example in hero.showcase %}
    <div class="lab-panel" id="lab-panel-{{ loop.index0 }}" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="lab-tab-{{ loop.index0 }}" tabindex="0" {% if not loop.first %}hidden{% endif %}>
      <div class="lab-request"><span class="small-label">이런 일이 필요하다면</span><p>{{ requests[loop.index0] }}</p><div class="request-process" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><p class="lab-disclaimer">{{ studio.example_note | br | safe }}</p></div>
      <div class="lab-output"><div class="paper-under" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="output-paper"><div class="paper-heading"><span>{{ outputs[loop.index0] }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>{% set icon = loop.index0 %}{% include "lab-transformation.njk" %}<div class="lab-original-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% include "practical-icon.njk" %}</div><h3>{{ example.title }}</h3><p>{{ example.brief }}</p><ol>{% for stage in example.stages %}<li>{{ stage }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></div></div>
    </div>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="studio-wrap lab-foot"><span>질문을 구체적으로. 결과는 우리 사역에 맞게.</span><a href="#together">활용 장면 더 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
</section>
<section class="story-section studio-wrap" id="together">
  <div class="story-visual"><div class="story-label">사역 속 AI 활용</div><h2>{{ studio.story_heading | br | safe }}</h2><div class="story-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="art-ring"></div><div class="art-paper"><span class="art-caption">설교준비</span><div class="art-icon">{% set icon = 0 %}{% include "practical-icon.njk" %}</div><div class="art-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><span class="art-marker">01 / 04</span></div></div>
  <div class="story-chapters">
    {% for example in hero.showcase %}<article data-chapter="{{ loop.index0 }}"><span class="chapter-number">0{{ loop.index }} · {{ example.label }}</span><h3>{{ example.title }}</h3><p>{{ example.brief }}</p><span class="chapter-result">{{ example.stages | join(' · ') }}</span></article>{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="tools-section" id="tools" aria-labelledby="tools-heading">
<div class="studio-wrap tools-heading"><h2 id="tools-heading">{{ tools.heading }}</h2><p>{{ tools.lead }}</p></div><div class="tool-list">
{% for tool in tools.items %}<article class="shorts-feature tool-entry" aria-labelledby="tool-name-{{ loop.index0 }}"><div class="studio-wrap shorts-inner"><div class="shorts-copy"><span class="small-label">{{ tool.category }}</span><h3 id="tool-name-{{ loop.index0 }}" class="tool-name">{{ tool.name }}</h3><p class="tool-tagline">{{ tool.tagline }}</p><p>{{ tool.description }}</p><div class="tool-actions">{% if tool.intro_url %}<a class="studio-link" href="{{ tool.intro_url }}">도구 소개 보기 ↗</a>{% endif %}{% if tool.app_url %}<a class="studio-link" href="{{ tool.app_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">도구 열기 ↗</a>{% endif %}</div></div><div class="shorts-art" aria-hidden="true">{% if tool.visual == 'shorts' %}<div class="video-sheet"><div class="video-screen"><div class="sound-wave">{% for i in range(0,17) %}<i style="--bar:{{ i }};--height:{{ 16 + (i * 13) % 50 }}px"></i>{% endfor %}</div><span class="video-caption">말씀을 나누는<br>또 하나의 방법</span></div><div class="video-timeline"><span></span></div><span class="video-note">{{ tool.name }} · 화면 구성 예시</span></div><span class="shorts-orbit">함께 나누는 말씀</span>{% else %}<div class="tool-generic-visual">{% set icon = 3 %}{% include "practical-icon.njk" %}</div>{% endif %}</div></div></article>{% endfor %}
</div></section>
<section class="learning-section studio-wrap" id="for-whom" data-lower-motion><div class="section-intro"><h2>{{ studio.learning_heading | br | safe }}</h2><p>네 가지 활용 영역에서 필요한 일을 고르고,<br>질문부터 결과물까지 함께 연습합니다.</p></div><ol class="learning-steps">{% for item in learning.items %}<li data-reveal><span>0{{ loop.index }}</span><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.body }}</p></li>{% endfor %}</ol></section>
<section class="about-section studio-wrap" id="about" data-lower-motion><div><span class="small-label">함께하는 사람</span><h2>{{ studio.about_heading | br | safe }}</h2><div class="about-portrait-frame"><img class="about-portrait" src="{{ studio.profile_image }}" alt="신수철 목사 프로필" width="180" height="239" loading="lazy"></div><p class="about-name">{{ studio.profile_name | br | safe }} <span>{{ studio.profile_title | br | safe }}</span><span>{{ studio.profile_role | br | safe }}</span></p></div><div class="about-copy"><p>{{ about.lead | br | safe }}</p><dl>{% for item in about.items %}<div><dt>{{ item.kind }}</dt><dd>{% if item.link_url and item.link_label %}{{ item.body | replace(item.link_label, '<a href="' ~ item.link_url ~ '" rel="noopener">' ~ item.link_label ~ '</a>') | safe }}{% else %}{{ item.body }}{% endif %}</dd></div>{% endfor %}</dl></div></section>
<section class="studio-posts studio-wrap" id="posts" data-lower-motion><div class="section-intro"><h2>{{ studio.posts_heading | br | safe }}</h2><a class="studio-link" href="https://blog.naver.com/church_ai_lab">블로그 더 보기 ↗</a></div><ul>{% for post in collections.posts %}<li><a href="{{ post.data.external_url or post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>
<section class="studio-contact" id="contact" data-lower-motion><div class="studio-wrap"><p>설교준비 · 목회행정 · 교회교육 · 나만의 AI 도구</p><h2>{{ studio.contact_heading | br | safe }}</h2>{% include "contact-choices.njk" %}</div></section>
